{title: Forever}
{key: A}
{credits: Tomlin · 2000 Worship Together/Six Steps Music · CCLI #3148428}

[Intro]
| A  F#m  E  D |

[Verse 1]
Give [A]thanks to the Lord
Our God and King
His love endures forever
For [D]He is good
He is above all things
His love endures for[A]ever

[Pre-Chorus Short]
Sing [E]praise sing [D/F#]praise

[Verse 2]
With a [A]mighty hand
And outstretched arm
His love endures forever
[D]For the life
That has been reborn
His love endures for[A]ever

[Pre-Chorus 1]
Sing [E]praise sing [D/F#]praise
Sing [E]praise sing [D/F#]praise

[Chorus 1]
For[A]ever God is faithful
For[F#m7]ever God is strong
For[E]ever God is with us
For[D]ever

[Verse 3]
From the [A]rising to
The setting sun
His love endures forever
[D]And by the grace of God
We will carry on
His love endures for[A]ever

> Pre-Chorus 2 = Pre-Chorus 1

> Chorus 2 Double = Chorus 1
x2

[Ending]
For[A]ever
